# Titan 2 Elite on-screen keyboard: with "Keep the emoji picker open after typing an emoji" off,
# the full picker closes after an emoji and after a skin tone, whatever the SYM auto-close settings.
# Needs the setting off (the runner does not change settings), 😀 and 👋🏽 visible when the picker
# opens and room for the note body above the on-screen keyboard (number row off on the T2E).
screen press bar:emoji
wait 800
screen press emoji:😀
wait 500
screen press plektra_key_a
expect 😀a
screen press bar:emoji
wait 800
screen hold emoji:👋🏽
wait 1000
screen release emoji:👋🏽
wait 300
screen press variant:👋🏿
wait 500
screen press plektra_key_b
expect 😀a👋🏿b
